#*: i can't seem to find any how-to regarding connecting a terminal to a linux '''boxen''' via parallel port...
#*'''2002,''' Gregory Seidman, ''[http://groups.google.com/group/muc.lists.debian.user/browse_thread/thread/f622a3da1225f845/7aecf55aabe92b83?lnk=st&q=boxen&rnum=4#7aecf55aabe92b83  serving debian to redhat boxen]'' in muc.lists.debian.user
